        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "I didn't expect you to be here, Leon."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "I heard someone attacked you, so I rushed over."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Nothing major happened, thanks to Texas's help."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "But we're at another dead end."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "Just drop it already, Lavinia."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$m_bat_imprisonment_intro",
            "key": "$m_bat_imprisonment_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Leon... I believe we had an agreement not to bring up things that might spark an argument at the table."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "Now's not the time for that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "No, it's the only thing that lets us sit together and share a meal regardless of our positions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "If you insist on breaking it, then I'm afraid I must take my leave, 'Padrone' Leontuzzo."
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "You're messing around with your life on the line here!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "I've been 'messing around with my life on the line' since the moment I became a judge in this city, Padrone."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "I'm planning to talk to the Rossatis."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "I don't care what they think about Cellinia's presence. This is a discussion they can't avoid."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "We have the initiative. As long as we can keep them down, it doesn't matter if we have a double-agent in our midst, or other famiglie at our throats. We'll suppress them all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "That's not where the problem lies."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Things are incredibly tense throughout the city right now, and everyone's speculating about who did it. The situation will only spiral out of control unless we stabilize it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "I'll be frank. If you can really find the murderer, I'll spare no expense to help you push the case forward."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "But right now, the other side has already come prepared. What you encountered today was, without a doubt, a warning shot."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "Your investigation won't go anywhere, even if you try to press the issue. You're only going to land yourself in more trouble."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "So I should just go along with your plans, drop the investigation, and let this case fizzle out?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "Lavinia, you're not the kind of person to get carried away by her emotions."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Leon, you've worked with Ministro Carracci before. You probably knew him better than I do."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Regardless of how he ended up in that position to begin with, he still was a person who could make the city a better place."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "These things happen every single day."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "So are those in Siracusa who want to be good people doomed to die?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "You're more important to me than he was."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "To you, Ministro Carracci's death might be nothing more than a spell of heavy rain."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "The rain won't fall on anyone who's standing inside, so you just wonder why it's lasting for so long."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "If you're feeling particularly generous, you might even hand out some umbrellas to the people on the streets."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "But for me... I'm sick and tired of asking myself how long I plan to stand there under the roof."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "But how are you going to stop the rain all by yourself?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "At least this time, I don't want to feel like a helpless bystander watching someone like Carracci die for nothing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "I've already done too much against my will."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Leon, if - and I mean if - my life could be exchanged for something..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "That might make things a bit more bearable for me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "One thing I learned from the Columbians is\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "If you want someone to listen to you, incentives can be more useful than violence."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "But that doesn't mean I won't ever choose violence, Lavinia."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "And this is exactly what I was talking about: the biggest difference between you and me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "You've always got the option of violence, but you refrain from using it because of your upbringing and self-control. I'd even like to thank you for your kindness."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "That's not what I meant."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "And I'm not blaming you either, Leon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "For you to even consider why the rain hasn't stopped yet is already exceptionally rare to see."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "But you are the next head of Famiglia Bellone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "And I'm just a judge who can't help herself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Our world views have always been fundamentally different."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Let's leave things here, Leon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "If you really want to help me, then keep doing what you need to do."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "If you're able to negotiate with the Rossatis, that would already help ease up the situation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "However, unless you lock me up right now, nobody will stop me from finding the murderer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "Silence falls across the restaurant."
    },
    {
        "text": "Leontuzzo wants to think of something else to say, but all the words he can muster in his mind come up blank."
    },
    {
        "text": "His throat twitches twice, but no words come out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Hold on."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Texas?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Oh right, you should head back with Leon. He'll need you in his negotiations with the Rossatis."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "No, I have a better idea."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "You needed a culprit, right? Then I'll be the culprit."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#15$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Do you even know what you're saying...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "It's the quickest way to get the situation under control."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "I... don't need others to take pity on me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Don't get the wrong idea."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "I'm doing this for myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "You're both right. If things continue like this, the situation will only get more and more chaotic, making it harder to find who's actually pulling the strings."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "The best method we have is to find the killer before everything spirals out of control."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "And of course, the other side will do everything in their power to prevent that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "So you're going to offer yourself up as bait?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Nobody else is a juicy enough target. I might just fit the bill."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "You'd make Texas into the real criminals, and sacrifice some renown to take on all the blame, using peoples' ignorance of your famiglia."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "And after that, you can release me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "That <i>would</i> be the fastest way to stabilize the situation, while also potentially drawing the true mastermind out of hiding."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "An ambitious plan... but it might be worth a shot."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "However, you're the last of the Texas bloodline, and this is Siracusa."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Personally, the most important thing about the Texas name is the reputation it brings me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "As I said before, I only have one goal: to see through my agreement with Bellone, and then leave Siracusa."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "Then why... Why would you go out of your way to do this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "I also have a number of friends who are trying to change things for the better, in a place called Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "I'd never accept them dying in vain either."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "If this plan goes well..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "It might even put the other forces behind the scenes in counter-check."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "I'm really starting to count my lucky stars that you're on our side."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Spare me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "If this is what we're going with, we'll need this trial to be a barn-burner. Ultimately, that's the only way we're going to keep the other famiglie down."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "I'll handle all the other arrangements."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "Now's our chance to hit back."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Then can you give me your assurance that you'll let me leave Siracusa?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "I swear this to you: once we successfully execute this plan, nobody will pursue you ever again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "Those who've kept an eye on you, be it the Rossatis or any other famiglia, will only know that..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "'Cellinia Texas broke out of prison and fled Siracusa.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo",
        "text": "Sorry, Lavinia. This might fly in the face of the dignity of the law."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "No... I don't think so."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#15$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia",
        "text": "All that remains... is to see things through."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
